      "created_at": "2025-10-10T12:06:53.102Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi Sir/Ma’am,<br>\nI had taken the System commands course last term and unfortunately wasn’t able to score well in the OPPE, which is why I got the I_OP grade. I have opted for repeat-oppe only this term, so I wanted to know what all should I submit to be eligible for OPPE this term? Is submitting the BPT’s enough, or should I submit the weekly assignments too? I understand that all my other assignment, quiz, end term marks will be carried over, do I still have to submit the BPT also or am I directly eligible for OPPE this term based on my BPT scores of last term?</p>\n<p>Thanks and regards,<br>\nArnav</p>",
